{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55662","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 六十 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 六十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独行独坐任天然，幽隐难逢世网牵。\n一志直教齐大道，万般总是涉因缘。\n水磨涧石平如镜，春引岩藤直似弦。\n虚幻已知休更续，蹄轮应不到山前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55662.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55662","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}